{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785994851655844001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"self-shovel-graft","assignee":null,"author":"Joe Oakhart","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":1},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1783056792613990001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[],"description":"# BUG: child-certification check fails OPEN on a store read error\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n1. Close a parent whose child is force-closed (uncertified) while `list_tickets(parent=…)` transiently raises.\n2. `completion.py:73-76` catches and returns `([], [])` → `certifiable=True` → parent closes SIGNED over the uncertified child.\n\nExpected: a children-enumeration error withholds certification (fail-closed), like `attest._attested_delivered:668-677`.\nActual: fails open → certification-laundering path.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] On a children-enumeration error, `_child_closure_findings` withholds certification (certifiable=False) or fails the precheck loudly; the \"no children found\" fast path is preserved for the empty (not errored) case.\n- [ ] Regression test simulates the read error and asserts the parent is NOT signed.\n- [ ] Commit carries a `rebar-ticket:` trailer.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","9322-f84a-e047-4471"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"9322-f84a-e047-4471","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"ffb3-730f-bd48-47f1","ticket_type":"bug","title":"BUG: child-certification check fails OPEN on a store read error","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["ec882c40-aad7-41c5-a008-9a1475e4d953"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785994851655844001,"uuid":"7f6172de-7345-4527-b85d-1790fc5de3c3"}